OL,3,GNEWSAHusband of woman who died at 32 in
OL,4,Acancer drug plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who died from
OL,7,Fbreast cancer aged 32 are calling for a
OL,8,Flife-extending treatment to be made
OL,9,Favailable on the NHS in England.
OL,11,FFionnuala Quinlan-Bennett, from Crawley
OL,12,Fin West Sussex, died in June after
OL,13,Fbeing told the disease had spread to
OL,14,Fher bones and liver.
OL,16,FHer family say a drug called Enhertu,
OL,17,Favailable in Scotland and several other
OL,18,Fcountries, could have given her more
OL,19,Ftime.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
